    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense. But I've seen some people—including some doctors or biologists—saying that the distinction you're making is actually unscientific and that sex and gender are inseparable. How do you respond to that? Is their view just wrong, or is there actually a debate going on?",
