      "content": "I hear you, but it sounds like you're saying their arguments aren't even worth considering because they're just \"political.\" If there are experts who are using scientific data to argue that the distinction is flawed, shouldn't those arguments be treated as part of the scientific discussion rather than just being dismissed as an ideology?",
